<h3>The Income Approach (Earning)</h3>

<p>Every dollar spent on output becomes income for someone. The income approach adds up wages, rent, interest, and profits. Added together: <strong>GDP = Wages + Rent + Interest + Profits + Depreciation + (Indirect Taxes - Subsidies)</strong></p>

